tyleWidthY" type="I"><help>Determines the width of the vertical grid lines in the chart background along the Y-axis.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Length X" name="gridLineStyleLengthX" type="I"><help>Sets the length of the horizontal grid lines in the chart background along the X-axis.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Length Y" name="gridLineStyleLengthY" type="I"><help>Sets the length of the vertical grid lines in the chart background along the Y-axis.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Gap Length X" name="gridLineStyleLengthGapX" type="I"><help>Sets the gap length between horizontal grid lines in the chart background along the X-axis.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Gap Length Y" name="gridLineStyleLengthGapY" type="I"><help>Sets the gap length between vertical grid lines in the chart background along the Y-axis.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Offset X" name="gridLineStyleOffsetX" type="S"><help>Shifts the vertical grid lines horizontally. Accepts two values: offset from the left edge and offset from the right edge.</help><defaultValue>0, 0</defaultValue></field><field description="Grid Line Offset Y" name="gridLineStyleOffsetY" type="S"><help>Shifts the horizontal grid lines vertically. Accepts two values: offset from the top edge and offset from the bottom edge.</help><defaultValue>0, 0</defaultValue></field><field description="Date and Time Format" name="dateTimeFormat" type="S"><help>Defines the way timestamps are displayed when appearing on the X axis.</help><defaultValue>HH:mm:ss</defaultValue></field><field description="Tooltip Date and Time Format" name="tooltipDateTimeFormat" type="S"><help>Defines the way timestamps are displayed when appearing in tooltips.</help><defaultValue>HH:mm:ss</defaultValue></field><field description="Chart Padding" name="c