ltValue></field><field description="Preferred Height" name="dockPreferredHeight" type="I"><help>Desired height of the dockable window when split into another component or a dashboard.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Minimum Width" name="dockMinimumWidth" type="I"><help>Minimum width of the dockable window when split into another component or a dashboard. Overridden when the viewscreen does not have sufficient space for the minimum width.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Minimum Height" name="dockMinimumHeight" type="I"><help>Minimum height of the dockable window when split into another component or a dashboard. Overridden when the viewscreen does not have sufficient space for the minimum height.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Tab ID" name="tabId" type="S"><help>Dockable tab identifier, which by default is the dockable component name.</help><defaultValue/></field><field description="Panel ID" name="panelId" type="S"><help>Identified of the panel the dockable component is located in.</help><defaultValue/></field><field description="Order ID" name="orderId" type="I"><help>Index of tab the dockable component will occupy in a tabbed panel. Indexed from zero, where 0 is the first tab, 1 is the second tab, and so on.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Active Tab" name="dockActive" type="B"><help>Indicates that the dockable component is the selected tab, when that the component is in a tabbed panel.</help><aliases><alias>active</alias></aliases><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Horizontal Position" name="gridx" type="I"><help>In a grid layout, a grid column the component is located in. In an absolute layout, horizontal (X) coordinate of the component in pixels.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Vertical Position" name="gridy" type="I"><help>In a grid layout, a grid row the component is located in. 