esn't overflow the container&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;b>Unset&lt;/b> — cancels inheritance of this property from any sources (e.g. dashboard Style property)&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;b>Visible&lt;/b> — the content will always be visible even it overflows the container&lt;/li>&lt;/ul></help><defaultValue>auto</defaultValue></field><field description="Visible" name="visible" type="B"><help>Controls whether the component is displayed.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Variables Storage" name="variablesStorage" type="T"><defaultValue><table><format/></table></defaultValue></field><field description="Breakpoint Data" name="gridBreakpoints" type="T"><defaultValue><table><format/></table></defaultValue></field><field description="Context Menu" name="contextMenu" type="T"><defaultValue><table><format/></table></defaultValue></field><field description="Show Header" name="showHeader" type="B"><help>Configures whether the dockable window header should be displayed.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Header Title" name="dockTitle" type="S"><help>Dockable window header text.</help><aliases><alias>description</alias></aliases><defaultValue/></field><field description="Header Icon" name="dockIcon" type="T"><defaultValue><table><format/></table></defaultValue></field><field description="Maximizable" name="maximizable" type="B"><help>Configures whether the dockable window can be maximized.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Collapsible" name="collapsible" type="B"><help>Configures whether the dockable window can be collapsed.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Movable" name="dockMovable" type="B"><help>Configures whether the dockable window can be moved.</help><defaultValue>1</defaultValue></field><field description="Collapsed" name="dockCollapsed" type="B"><help>Configures whether the dockable window is collapsed.</help><defaultValue>0</defaultValue></field><field description="Floa